        "AbstractText": "The pathway of a patient suffering from cancer can stretch over years, marked by multiple examinations, treatments and procedures. These can all result in induced pain which can be prevented thanks to the knowledge and skills of the caregivers along with pharmacological and non-pharmacological treatments."
